## Article 118. General provisions on procedural timeframes

```catala
declaration scope Article118GeneralDeadlines:
  input deadline content ProceduralDeadline
  output deadlineIsBinding content YesNo
  output deadlineCanBeExtended content YesNo

scope Article118GeneralDeadlines:
  label binding definition deadlineIsBinding equals Yes

# Deadlines can be extended only if the deadline type allows it
  label extendable_default definition deadlineCanBeExtended equals No

  label extendable_available exception extendable_default
  definition deadlineCanBeExtended under condition
    deadline.restorationAvailable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 119. Calculation of procedural timeframes

```catala
declaration scope Article119DeadlineCalculation:
  input deadlineDays content integer
  input startDayIsWorkingDay content YesNo
  input lastDayIsWeekend content YesNo
  input lastDayIsHoliday content YesNo
  input nextWorkingDayAfterWeekend content YesNo
  output calculatedDeadlineDays content integer
  output deadlineExtendedToNextWorkingDay content YesNo

scope Article119DeadlineCalculation:
# Duration is as specified
  label duration definition calculatedDeadlineDays equals deadlineDays

# If last day is weekend or holiday, deadline extends to next working day
  label extended_default definition deadlineExtendedToNextWorkingDay equals No

  label extended_weekend exception extended_default
  definition deadlineExtendedToNextWorkingDay under condition
    lastDayIsWeekend = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label extended_holiday exception extended_default
  definition deadlineExtendedToNextWorkingDay under condition
    lastDayIsHoliday = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 120. Deadline for filing administrative case

```catala
declaration scope Article120FilingDeadline:
  input calc content DeadlineCalculation
  output filingDeadlineDays content integer
  output filingDeadlineExpired content YesNo

scope Article120FilingDeadline:
# 6 months for individuals to file
  label deadline_individual definition filingDeadlineDays under condition
    calc.isIndividual = Yes
    consequence equals 180

# 3 months for authorities
  label deadline_authority definition filingDeadlineDays under condition
    calc.isAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals 90

# Check if deadline expired
  label expired_yes definition filingDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.deadlineType = CaseFilingDeadline
    and calc.caseFiledDaysAgo > 180
    and calc.isIndividual = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label expired_yes_authority definition filingDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.deadlineType = CaseFilingDeadline
    and calc.caseFiledDaysAgo > 90
    and calc.isAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label expired_no_individual definition filingDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.deadlineType = CaseFilingDeadline
    and calc.caseFiledDaysAgo <= 180
    and calc.isIndividual = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label expired_no_authority definition filingDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.deadlineType = CaseFilingDeadline
    and calc.caseFiledDaysAgo <= 90
    and calc.isAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 121. Deadline for filing appeal

```catala
declaration scope Article121AppealDeadline:
  input calc content DeadlineCalculation
  output appealDeadlineDays content integer
  output appealDeadlineExpired content YesNo

scope Article121AppealDeadline:
# 30 days for appeal
  label appeal_deadline definition appealDeadlineDays equals 30

  label appeal_expired definition appealDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.appealFiledDaysAfterDecision > 30
    consequence equals Yes

  label appeal_valid definition appealDeadlineExpired under condition
    calc.appealFiledDaysAfterDecision <= 30
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 122. Restoration of missed deadline

```catala
declaration scope Article122DeadlineRestoration:
  input calc content DeadlineCalculation
  output deadlineCanBeRestored content YesNo

scope Article122DeadlineRestoration:
  label restore_default definition deadlineCanBeRestored equals No

# Deadline can be restored for good cause
  label restore_good_cause exception restore_default
  definition deadlineCanBeRestored under condition
    calc.goodCauseForDelay = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 123. Suspension of procedural timeframes

```catala
declaration scope Article123DeadlineSuspension:
  input proceedingSuspended content YesNo
  input suspensionReason content YesNo
  output deadlineSuspended content YesNo

scope Article123DeadlineSuspension:
  label suspend_default definition deadlineSuspended equals No

  label suspend_exception exception suspend_default
  definition deadlineSuspended under condition
    proceedingSuspended = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
